<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zoltek cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zoltek cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Zoltek Cos Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and maintained its long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 43-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
